rule (modulo E) SeedA:
   [ ] --> [ State( 'a' ) ]

rule (modulo E) SeedB:
   [ ] --> [ State( 'b' ) ]

rule (modulo E) Use:
   [ State( x ) ] --[ Used( x ) ]-> [ Out( x ) ]
